{"id":"00a1e20ba65f1f5a","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-typed-truth.md","title":"分层去引号与 Halbach 的有类型理论判据","display":"df-typed-truth — 分层去引号与 Halbach 的有类型理论判据","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-typed-truth","aliases":["91-df-typed-truth"],"display":"df-typed-truth — 分层去引号与 Halbach 的有类型理论判据","depends_on":["[[91-df-typed-language]]","[[91-df-coded-syntax]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-typed-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-typed-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-typed-truth — 分层去引号与 Halbach 的有类型理论判据"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"38c875c58a0bf84c\" href=\"?note=38c875c58a0bf84c\" title=\"91-df-coded-syntax\">91-df-coded-syntax</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T^n\">\\(\\mathcal L_T^n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a7ac1c668908eae\" href=\"?note=7a7ac1c668908eae\" title=\"91-df-typed-language\">91-df-typed-language</a> 的有限分层语言和谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是经典 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 理论。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(D_0=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(D_T=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 是自然句法谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\">\\(\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\\)</span> 为原分层模式记号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S)\\)</span> 是原书 Definition 10.1 的另一个理论性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{T^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{T^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S)\\coloneqq\n[S\\vdash\\forall a(T(a)\\to D_0(a))]\\ \\lor\\\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n[S\\vdash\\neg\\forall x(D_T(x)\\land\\neg D_0(x)\\to(\\varphi(x)\\leftrightarrow T(x)))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S)\\coloneqq\n[S\\vdash\\forall a(T(a)\\to D_0(a))]\\ \\lor\\\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n[S\\vdash\\neg\\forall x(D_T(x)\\land\\neg D_0(x)\\to(\\varphi(x)\\leftrightarrow T(x)))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个定义须区分：分层模式限制每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^n\">\\(T^n\\)</span> 的双条件实例；理论判据则针对原书的单真理谓词系统，允许它在句法上对任何数字成式。\n第一个判据分支限制真理域；第二个分支要求理论不反驳任何基础语言可定义的、在含真理句上的候选外延。原书明确称此判据为初步提议，并据此把 TB、UTB、CT 判为有类型。不一致理论因第一分支也被判为有类型，这是原书的约定，不擅自加一致性改变定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 10.1 及说明，印刷页 128–131，PDF 页 139–142；分层模式见 §9.1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-coded-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"38c875c58a0bf84c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-coded-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-typed-language","status":"resolved","id":"7a7ac1c668908eae","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T^n$、$T^n$ 为 [[91-df-typed-language]] 的有限分层语言和谓词；$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是经典 $\\mathcal L_T$ 理论。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T^n","display":false},{"tex":"T^n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"D_0=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"D_T=\\operatorname{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}typed\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Typed\\text{-}Truth}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{T^n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T^n}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TypedTh}(S)\\coloneqq\n[S\\vdash\\forall a(T(a)\\to D_0(a))]\\ \\lor\\\n\\neg\\exists\\varphi(x)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n[S\\vdash\\neg\\forall x(D_T(x)\\land\\neg D_0(x)\\to(\\varphi(x)\\leftrightarrow T(x)))].","display":true},{"tex":"T^n","display":false}],"bytes":1911,"backlinks":[{"id":"41d9670193aa08f6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52e708105e8ce779","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}$，$T$ 为一元谓词，$S\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$；$\\operatorname{TypedTh}$ 见 [[91-df-typed-truth]]。"},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-typed-truth]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativity-proof.md]]\n[[91-df-consistency-predicate.md]]\n[[91-df-continuity.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[91-df-diagonal-lemma-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-disquotational-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-expressive-completeness.md]]\n[[91-df-external-consistency.md]]\n[[91-df-external-logic.md]]\n[[91-df-external-negation.md]]\n[[91-df-extrinsic-fixed-point.md]]\n[[91-df-fixed-point-model.md]]\n[[91-df-gap-sentence.md]]\n[[91-df-global-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-global-reflection.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-language.md]]\n[[91-df-ground-model.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchical-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-hierarchy-of-truth-theories.md]]\n[[91-df-implication-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-induction-schema.md]]\n[[91-d